    "faq.eyebrow": "Help & Support",
    "faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
    "faq.subtitle": "Find clear answers to the most common questions about shopping, shipping, returns, marketplace selling, and services at Styliiiish.",
    "faq.sectionShipping": "Shipping & Delivery",
    "faq.sectionReturns": "Returns & Refunds",
    "faq.sectionMarketplace": "Marketplace (Sell Your Dress)",
    "faq.sectionOrders": "Products & Orders",
    "faq.sectionRental": "Dress Rental Services",
    "faq.sectionSupport": "Contact & Support",
    "faq.q1": "How long does delivery take for ready-to-ship items?",
    "faq.a1": "Ready-to-ship items are prepared within 1–2 business days and delivered within 1–3 business days. Total estimated delivery time is 2–4 business days.",
    "faq.q2": "How long does delivery take for made-to-order items?",
    "faq.a2": "Made-to-order items require 6–7 business days for preparation before shipment, followed by 1–3 business days for delivery. Total estimated delivery time is 7–10 business days.",
    "faq.q3": "Do you ship outside Egypt?",
    "faq.a3": "No. Styliiiish currently provides shipping services within Egypt only through trusted courier partners.",
    "faq.q4": "Can I return or exchange my order?",
    "faq.a4": "Yes, returns or exchanges are accepted within 3 days of delivery if the item is unused, unworn, and in its original condition.",
    "faq.q5": "Which items are non-returnable?",
    "faq.a5": "Used or worn dresses, customized or made-to-order items, and products marked as final sale are not eligible for return or refund.",
    "faq.q6": "How does Styliiiish Marketplace work?",
    "faq.a6": "Styliiiish Marketplace allows individuals to list and sell their own dresses. Styliiiish facilitates payment processing, delivery coordination, and customer support.",
    "faq.q7": "What is the marketplace commission?",
    "faq.a7": "Styliiiish applies a 50% marketplace service fee. Sellers enter their net price, and the final price shown to buyers includes the service fee.",
    "faq.q8": "When do sellers receive their payment?",
    "faq.a8": "Seller payouts are processed after successful delivery, according to Styliiiish verification and payout procedures.",
    "faq.q9": "Are all products available in multiple sizes?",
    "faq.a9": "Each product is available in one ready size. If another size is requested, the item will be made to order.",
    "faq.q10": "Can I cancel my order after placing it?",
    "faq.a10": "Orders can only be canceled before preparation or tailoring begins. Please contact support as soon as possible after placing your order.",
    "faq.q11": "Can I rent dresses online?",
    "faq.a11": "No. Dress rental services are available exclusively at our physical branch and are not processed through the website.",
    "faq.q12": "How can I contact Styliiiish support?",
    "faq.a12": "You can contact us anytime at email@styliiiish.com.",
